be remembered for their  Christian walk  Lance he was recently this past Sunday  he preached and I was so proud it is  mini sermon was um being a good example  it's a two p court everybody just loved  it it's like losing one of your best  friends I'm gonna close this best  friends you'll never separate from have  you thought a lot about that time on the  boat thinking why me why do I have to  leave you got to live to share your  brother's memory and your father and you  have purpose you have a purpose Lauren  you got big things ahead of you think I  know I needed you now a lot of people  have been wondering why the duck boat  was allowed to go out on the water under  those conditions Thursday Lauren says  the sky was clear and the water was calm  when they first set out and then halfway  through the trip conditions took a  sudden turn for the worse with tragic  results obviously we've heard that from  people who have talked about the  incident that same exact thing but that  story was so hard Dana that she would  get a call from her husband and say Pam  this isn't good yeah that's what that's  what haunts me that they knew how bad  this yeah she saw the weather warning  when she was shopping so she called them  and then when she hung up with him she  tried to reach him again couldn't reach  him and then was waiting to hear it it's  unfathomable she did not have on a life  - no she told us that they were never  told to put on the lifejackets they got  a very quick safety briefing in the  beginning and she really didn't know she  talked about trying to struggle to get  out but it wasn't clear exactly how she  was able to and then she just came up it  was such a mom moved to the way she  tenderly  moved her daughter's hair and she said  God no God knows that I needed her it's  just guy stuff they have their church at  home that's really embraced them as well  which I know she told me has helped them  tremendously talks about needing to lean  on people thank God she has that church  and that they have each other maybe she  ate them sharing the story though very  much so very much so honoring as far as  it is to here  thank you very much Dana
 

